F 32 8 periph_id_7
DESC Peripheral ID 7
R 0x28 64 RO - por_cfgm_component_id_0_component_id_1
RESET 0xf00000000d 0xff000000ff
DESC Functions as the component ID 0 and component ID 1 register.
F 0 8 component_id_0
