DESC Contains base address of child configuration node. NOTE: There will be as many child pointer registers in the Global Config Unit as the number of XP's on the chip. Each successive child pointer register will be at the next 8 byte address boundary. Each successive child pointer register will be named with the suffix corresponding to the register number. For example por_cfgm_child_pointer_<0:255> 
