DESC Specifies the Port ID for Agent ID 39
R 0xd58 64 - S por_cxla_agentid_to_portid_reg5
RESET 0x0 0xf0f0f0f0f0f0f0f
DESC Specifies the mapping of Agent ID to Port ID for Agent IDs 40 to 47.
SGO por_cxla_secure_register_groups_override.portid_ctl
