F 4 3 sf_size
DESC SF size 3'b000: ( 32KB * sf_num_ways) 3'b001: ( 64KB * sf_num_ways) 3'b010: (128KB * sf_num_ways) 3'b011: (256KB * sf_num_ways) 3'b100: (512KB * sf_num_ways)
F 8 5 slc_num_ways
DESC Number of cache ways in the SLC
F 16 3 tag_ram_lat
