DESC Enables the advanced features of HNF CBusy handling
F 17 1 hnf_slc_mpam_cpor_enable
DESC Enable MPAM Cache Portion Partitioning for SLC 1'b1: Cache Portion Partitioning is enabled if supported in Hardware. 1'b0: Cache Portion Partitioning is disabled for SLC. NOTE: If MPAM is disabled at build time, this bit has no meaning.
F 18 1 hnf_slc_mpam_ccap_enable
DESC Enable MPAM Cache Capacity Partitioning for SLC 1'b1: Cache Capacity Partitioning is enabled if supported in Hardware. 1'b0: Cache Capacity Partitioning is disabled for SLC. NOTE: If MPAM is disabled at build time, this bit has no meaning.
F 24 1 hnf_mte_mode_dis
DESC Disables the MTE features in HNF when set to 1'b1
