DESC Enables the snoop filter's precise RNF vector in clustered mode when set to 1'b1
F 36 1 hnf_metadata_mode_dis
DESC Disables the METADATA features in HNF when set to 1'b1
F 38 1 hnf_stash_snp_dis
DESC Disables stashing snoop in HNF when set to 1'b1
