DESC Generate PCMO request for SLC and SF flush generated SN writes
F 4 1 hnf_force_flush_pcmo_deep_en
DESC Make PCMO request for SLC and SF flush generated SN writes as Deep PCMO. CONSTRAINT: hnf_force_flush_pcmo_deep_en is valid only if hnf_force_flush_pcmo_en bit is set. CONSTRAINT: This bit can be set only if ALL SNs in the system support deep attribute.
F 5 2 hnf_mpam_softlim_value
DESC Soft Limit value for MPAM capacity partitioning. 2'b00: Soft limit is 0% below hardlimit. 2'b01: Soft limit is 3.13% (1/32) below hardlimit 2'b10: Soft limit is 6.25% (1/16) below hardlimit 2'b11: Soft limit is 9.38% (3/32) below hardlimit NOTE: Default is 3.13% below hardlimit. If CMAX value set is at or below 12.5%, soft limit is ignored.
F 7 1 hnf_slc_repl_hint_use_en
DESC 1'b0: Interconnect generated SLC Replacement hints are used for eLRU. 1'b1: RN-F provided SLC Replacement hints are used for eLRU.
F 16 1 hnf_mte_memattr_cache_mode_en
DESC When set to 1'b1, it enables HNF to convert Non-cacheable requests to cacheable if MTE tags are required
F 17 1 hnf_mte_wrnosnp_txr_tag_drop_en
DESC When set to 1'b1, HNF will drop clean tags from a WriteNoSnp with tagop Transfer
F 20 1 hnf_mte_memattr_nc_tag_drop_en
DESC Enables HNF to drop any dirty tags for Non-Cacheable memory, when set to 1'b1
F 21 1 hnf_sf_precise_setway_en
DESC Enables Precise setway hazard, when set to 1'b1
F 22 1 hnf_l3_replay_slow_mode_en
DESC Enables L3 arbitration slow mode in case of constant replays, when set to 1'b1
F 23 2 hnf_l3_replay_slow_mode_cnt_limit
DESC L3 arbitration throttle count limit, when enabled. 00: L3 Throttle is enabled after  512 setway haz replays 01: L3 Throttle is enabled after 1024 setway haz replays 10: L3 Throttle is enabled after 2048 setway haz replays 11: L3 Throttle is enabled after 4096 setway haz replays
F 25 1 hnf_be_all_ones_opt_dis
DESC Disable the optimizations related to BE=1's hint on WR_PTL from RNI
F 26 1 hnf_nonalloc_wr_snpclninv_dis
DESC Disable the snp type of snp_cln_inv on non-allocating writes. Send snp_uniq instead
F 27 1 hnf_nc_cmo_atomics_snpme_en
DESC When set to 1, all incoming non-cachable atomics and cmo's from RNF will be back-snooped
F 28 1 hnf_txrsp_comp_bypass_dis
DESC When set, TXRSP COMP bypass gets disabled for WEOE/EVICT
F 29 7 hnf_class_based_pocq_arb_dis
DESC Disables Class based arbitration for various POCQ arbiters. For each bit: 1'b0: Use Class based arbitration. 1'b1: Use QoS based arbitration. Legacy mode.
[35]: POCQ entry selection for SN Static Credit Grant return. [34]: POCQ entry selection for SLC/SF pipeline request. [33]: POCQ entry selection for TXRSP. [32]: POCQ entry selection for TXDAT. [31]: POCQ entry selection for TXREQ. [30]: POCQ entry selection for ADQ. [29]: Reserved for future use. 
