F 7 1 cbusy_sn_static_ot_mode_en
DESC Controls cbusy between HN-F and SN-F 1'b0: HN-F will dynamically throttle outstanding requests to SN-F 1'b1: HN-F will use fixed transactions count at each CBusy level at 1/4th POCQ granularity CONSTRAINT: For SN request throttling, CBusy aggregation is always based on SN_CBusy[1:0] and cbusy_alt_mode_en is inapplicable
