DESC MPAM PMU hardlimit and softlimit mask for PARTID [127:64] 1'b0: PARTID specified is not counted in PMU count. 1'b1: PARTID specified is counted in PMU count. Note: This mask is used only when por_hnf_pmu_mpam_sel is set for PARTID based counting.
R 0x2020 64 - - por_hnf_pmu_mpam_pardid_mask2
RESET 0x0 0xffffffffffffffff
DESC Functions as mask for PARTID[191:128] filter for MPM PMU events
F 0 64 pmu_mpam_partid_mask2
DESC MPAM PMU hardlimit and softlimit mask for PARTID [191:128] 1'b0: PARTID specified is not counted in PMU count. 1'b1: PARTID specified is counted in PMU count. Note: This mask is used only when por_hnf_pmu_mpam_sel is set for PARTID based counting.
R 0x2028 64 - - por_hnf_pmu_mpam_pardid_mask3
