DESC  This field controls the interleave size across all aggregated CXSA/CXLSA Devices 4'h0: 64B Interleaved 4'h1: 128B Interleaved 4'h2: 256B Interleaved 4'h3: 512B Interleaved .. 4'hF: 2MB Interleaved
F 40 3 htg13_sa_ports_cnt
DESC Specifies the number of CXSA/CXLSA device aggregated 3'b000: 1 port used 3'b001: 2 ports used 3'b010: 4 ports used 3'b011: 8 ports used 3'b100: 16 ports used others: Reserved
F 44 3 htg13_hash_addr_bits_sel
DESC SN hash address select(Valid for 3SN, 5SN, 6SN) 3'b000: [16:8]  address bits (Default) 3'b001: [17:9]  address bits 3'b010: [18:10] address bits 3'b011: [19:11] address bits 3'b100: [20:12] address bits 3'b101: [21:13] address bits Others: Reserved
