DESC Bit [31]: External or internal child node 1'b1: Indicates this child pointer points to a configuration node that is external to CMN-600 1'b0: Indicates this child pointer points to a configuration node that is internal to CMN-600 Bits [30]: Set to 1'b0 Bits [29:0]: Child node address offset relative to PERIPHBASE
