DESC Allows non-secure access to secure syscoreq_ctl registers
F 2 1 mpam_ctrl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure CHI port MPAM override register
F 3 1 multi_mesh_ctl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure Multi Mesh control registers
F 4 1 xy_override_ctl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure XY override registers
F 5 1 ldid_override_ctl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure LDID override registers
F 6 1 pa2setaddr_ctl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure PA to SETADDR control registers
F 7 1 ras_secure_access_override
DESC Allow non-secure access to secure RAS registers
