R 0xd20 64 - S por_mxp_p2_pa2setaddr_flex_slc
RESET 0x0 0xffffffffffffffff
DESC Functions as the SLC control register of PA to Set/TagAddr and vice versa conversion for HNF (flexible) on XP port 2. NOTE: There will be max. of 6 MXP Port registers based on MXP_NUM_DEV_PORT_PARAM value. Each successive MXP Port register will be at the next 8 byte address boundary.
