F 8 9 s1_mpam_partid
DESC Port S1 MPAM_PARTID value
F 24 1 s1_mpam_pmg
DESC Port S1 MPAM_PMG value
R 0xa38 64 - S por_rni_s2_mpam_control
RESET 0x0 0x101ff11
DESC Controls port S2 AXI/ACE slave interface MPAM override values
SGO por_rni_secure_register_groups_override.mpam_ctrl
